		{"id":"dff3855b3c03ac6f","type":"text","text":"Example: \n1. Create simple shape (e.g., cube) model or import model\n2. Perform Voronoi Tessellation on model - now voronoi cells are available\n3. Create curve \n4. Remove (subtract) cells which are close to curve","x":2015,"y":-2006,"width":405,"height":260},
